  "description": "Core contracts for the SpawnDev AI stack: chat sessions, Ollama/OpenAI-compatible API shapes, and tool-calling contracts. Shared by SpawnDev.AI.Server (desktop HTTP + browser-worker model server) and the browser demo.",
