  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - AiChatResult.Timings (AiChatTimings: load, prompt eval, eval) and AiChatUsage. AiMemoryStore: long-term memory (episodes, facts, lessons) with hard deletes that cascade to what was derived, ForgetSubject by stable ids, do-not-learn and pause, supersede history, compaction, one embedding model per store. SpeakerProfile.Id + ProfileRemoved / ProfileMerged events. SpeakerRegistry: strangers nobody names are forgotten (GuestLifetime, ExpireGuests, counted from FirstSeenTicks; named people never); GuestPrefix (a face registry files strangers as Visitor N, so voices and faces never merge by name); a named person outranks a near-duplicate guest (AbsorbDuplicateGuests). v1.2.0 - SpeakerRegistry and speaker contracts for speaker identification. Full history: CHANGELOG.md",
